<title>PORTUGAL: Lisbon bourse interrupted due technical problems.</title>
<headline>Lisbon bourse interrupted due technical problems.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade on Lisbon bourse was interrupted four minutes before the close due to technical problems, dealers said.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
